# Charter UI surfaces

When the task involves **charte graphique**, branding, theme tokens, colors, modals/sheets,
spinners, map cards, or “harmoniser le design”:

1. Read and follow `docs/CHARTER_UI_SURFACES.md`.
2. Prefer `colors.brand.*` from `src/constants/theme.ts` — no new dark ink sheets (`#121a1c`)
   or hardcoded `#0f1719` / `#334155` / `#122c33` on light screens.
3. Before closing, re-check every surface listed in that doc that could regress (spinners,
   bug-report form, photo/nav sheets, proposal wizard + distance chip, event detail actions,
   map overlay/card/markers, onboarding inputs/themes).
4. If you touch a new surface, **add it to** `docs/CHARTER_UI_SURFACES.md`.
